<!--T:1-->
Femiwiki needs two feeds.

<!--T:2-->
== A development blog ==
Each post is a page in the blog's category. A new page in that category becomes a new Fediverse post. This is the [[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Feed kinds#category</tvar>|<code>category</code>]] kind.

<!--T:3-->
== Release notes ==
Each deploy adds a section to the release notes page, <code>페미위키:업데이트</code>. A new section becomes a new Fediverse post. This is the [[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Feed kinds#section</tvar>|<code>section</code>]] kind.

<!--T:4-->
The section is written by a bot, so a feed of this kind counts bot edits.
